&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚀 The Context&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Decathlon is accelerating its global expansion through the &lt;strong&gt;Franchise model&lt;/strong&gt;. To support our partners worldwide (stores &amp;amp; back-office), we are building a dedicated Data squad. You will join a &quot;start-up within the group&quot; environment. You will be the &lt;strong&gt;key bridge&lt;/strong&gt; between Decathlon&#39;s massive internal data ecosystem and our external partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🎯 The Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your goal is threefold:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive the Franchise Business: &lt;/strong&gt;Act as the analytical partner for internal teams, providing deep-dive analyses and actionable insights to optimize operations (Stock, Supply, Pricing, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build &amp;amp; Deliver:&lt;/strong&gt; Ensure Franchise partners have visibility on their performance (Sales, Stock, KPIs) by providing reliable dashboards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bridge &amp;amp; Adapt:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with internal Decathlon business teams to &quot;port&quot; and adapt existing successful data products for the Franchise perimeter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are not just building charts; you are building the &lt;strong&gt;trust&lt;/strong&gt; our partners place in Decathlon’s data to manage their business and calculate their royalties.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💼 Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Analyse : help business partner to take the best decision, Analytics, viz,...&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Business Analysis &amp;amp; Insights&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Decision Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Actively help business partners take the best decisions regarding stock management, supply chain efficiency, and pricing strategies for the Franchise network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proactive Analytics:&lt;/strong&gt; Don&#39;t just answer questions; dig into the data to identify trends, anomalies, and business opportunities. Translate complex data sets into clear, actionable recommendations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Data Visualization &amp;amp; Delivery (Tableau)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the design, development, and maintenance of Tableau dashboards for Franchisees and internal Franchise teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptation Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with internal domains (Supply, Retail, Offer) to identify existing dashboards, understand their logic, and duplicate/adapt them for the Franchise context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;User Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Ensure dashboards are readable, actionable, and secure (Row Level Security is key).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytics Engineering (dbt &amp;amp; SQL)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modeling:&lt;/strong&gt; You don&#39;t wait for data to be ready. You use &lt;strong&gt;dbt&lt;/strong&gt; (on top of Databricks) to build your own marts and business layers from the raw data prepared by the Data Engineer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Logic:&lt;/strong&gt; Implement complex business rules (Royalties calculation, Taxable turnover, Margins) directly in the code base, ensuring auditability and version control.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management &amp;amp; Animation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Internal Negotiation:&lt;/strong&gt; Navigate the Decathlon ecosystem to find the right data owners and secure access to source dashboards/datasets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the referent for Franchisees regarding Data interpretation. Help them understand their KPIs and gather their feedback to improve our products.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote data-driven decision-making within the Franchise team (Expansion strategy, Partner selection).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document business rules and KPIs definitions to create a shared &quot;Franchise Language&quot;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🛠 Technical Environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Storage &amp;amp; Compute:&lt;/strong&gt; Databricks (Lakehouse architecture).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transformation:&lt;/strong&gt; dbt (SQL).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Visualization:&lt;/strong&gt; Tableau Software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;👤 Profile We Are Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in BI, Data analysis or Analytics Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retail experience is a strong plus (understanding of supply chain, stock rotation, pricing elasticity, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hard Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SQL:&lt;/strong&gt; Advanced level (Window functions, joins, performance tuning).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tableau:&lt;/strong&gt; Expert level (LODs, Parameters, complex blending, Server management is a plus).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;dbt/Modeling:&lt;/strong&gt; Good understanding of data modeling (Star Schema) and modern transformation workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soft Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Autonomous: &lt;/strong&gt;You know how to take a vague business request and turn it into a delivered product or a clear analytical answer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Partner:&lt;/strong&gt; You speak &quot;Retail&quot; and &quot;Finance&quot; as well as you speak SQL.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Resourceful:&lt;/strong&gt; You are not afraid to dig into legacy dashboards to understand how a KPI was calculated 5 years ago.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pedagogue:&lt;/strong&gt; You can explain a data discrepancy to a non-technical franchise owner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluent English is mandatory (international partners). French is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🎁 Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Your work directly impacts the business of our partners and their way of piloting their stores.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Construction:&lt;/strong&gt; You arrive at the beginning of the journey. There is still a lot to build, structure, and optimize.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modern stack : &lt;/strong&gt;You work on a state-of-the-art modern data stack (Databricks, dbt).&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
